// IntroString :
"P100479573" "Hey {VillainName}. You've done some really nice work getting rid of those Snakes, but we've got a new problem. One of the Snake pits has become really active lately, with large groups of them attacking key Arachnos positions. There's probably some sort of Snake leader in the pit who is directing them against these targets, so we need to take the leader out. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Head into the Snake pit and take out the leader.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P70944848" "Defeat Snake leader"
// SendOffString :
"P2944679685" "These Snakes defend their nests well, so you might want to look for some extra muscle to back you up."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P4143952701" "You take out the Snake leader yet? Get in that Snake pit and take 'im out!"

